    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Veil of Sanity: Echoes of the Carnival (Chapter 1)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the haunting world of <i>Veil of Sanity: Echoes of the Carnival</i>, the first chapter in a psychological horror series. Set in a derelict carnival, this game immerses players in a tense and atmospheric battle for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrilling Chase Gameplay</strong>: Evade the relentless pursuit of a terrifying clown while navigating the carnival grounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Problem-Solving Under Pressure</strong>: Fix broken generators, repair electrical boxes, and locate essential tools\u2014all while being hunted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Combat</strong>: Outsmart your foe by luring them into traps. Use tools you find to gain the upper hand and survive the night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Sanity System</strong>: Keep your mind intact by managing your fear and using rare resources to fend off psychological effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong>: Dive into the dark, abandoned carnival, exploring areas like twisted funhouses, eerie tents, and more.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first chapter offers a standalone horror experience that blends stealth, strategy, and light problem-solving with a tense and unfolding story. Future chapters will expand on the narrative with new threats, environments, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you survive long enough to uncover the truth?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Veil of Sanity: Echoes of the Carnival (Chapter 1)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the haunting world of <i>Veil of Sanity: Echoes of the Carnival</i>, the first chapter in a psychological horror series. Set in a derelict carnival, this game immerses players in a tense and atmospheric battle for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrilling Chase Gameplay</strong>: Evade the relentless pursuit of a terrifying clown while navigating the carnival grounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Problem-Solving Under Pressure</strong>: Fix broken generators, repair electrical boxes, and locate essential tools\u2014all while being hunted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Combat</strong>: Outsmart your foe by luring them into traps. Use tools you find to gain the upper hand and survive the night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Sanity System</strong>: Keep your mind intact by managing your fear and using rare resources to fend off psychological effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong>: Dive into the dark, abandoned carnival, exploring areas like twisted funhouses, eerie tents, and more.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first chapter offers a standalone horror experience that blends stealth, strategy, and light problem-solving with a tense and unfolding story. Future chapters will expand on the narrative with new threats, environments, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you survive long enough to uncover the truth?</strong></p>",
